    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπολελῠμένως</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>absolutely,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σχέσιν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				8.162
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				127
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> Gramm.,
				<i>in the positive degree,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατὰ σύγκρισιν</span> ('in the comparative'), <i><span class="en">
				Phryn.
				<u>PS</u>
				p.1
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> Rhet., <i>without
				regular pauses,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λέγειν,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακόψαι,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hermog.
				<u>Id.</u>
				1.9
			</span></i>.</div>
